Hussain Deen-e-Paiyambar Bacha Ke Dum Lenge<br>
Sitam Garou Ke Kaleje Hila Ke Dum Lenge<br>
<br>
1.Yeh Mana Aun-o-Mohd Bhot Hi Pyase Hai<br>
Magar Yeh Hyder-e-Karrar Ke Nawase Hai<br>
Sipah-e-Shaam Ku Ghar Tak Bhaaga Ke Dum Lenge<br>
<br>
2.Yeh Kehraha Hai Sakina Tere Chacha Ka Mizaj<br>
Durast Kardenge Pal Bhar Me Aashkiyan Ka Mazaj<br>
Jalal-e-Fatah-e-Khaibar Dikha Ke Dum Lenge<br>
<br>
3.Hai Pukhta Apne Irade Me Noujawan Akber<br>
Isiliye Toh Raghadhte Hai Aedhiya Akber<br>
Nishan-e-Daulat-e-Fasaq Meeta Ke Dum Lenge<br>
<br>
4.Yeh Aur Baat Hai Kamsin Hai Chal Nahin Sakte<br>
Magar Irade Bhi Asghar Ke Tal Nahin Sakte<br>
Yeh Gheware Se Maqtal Me Jaake Dum Lenge<br>
<br>
5.Hussain Wada-e-Teflee Nibhane Wale Hai<br>
Khuda Ki Rah Me Gardan Kaate Wale Hai<br>
Ghamou Se Chur Hai Jannat Me Jaake Dum Lenge<br>
<br>
6.Har Ek Dil Me Basainge Sheh Ka Gham Fakhri<br>
Har Ek Ghar Me Sajaienge Yeh Alam Fakhri<br>
Hussain Wale Hai Duniya Pe Chahe Dum Lenge
